  "title": "Convening of the Annual Shareholders’ Meeting on May 23, 2025",
  "summary": "Paris, March 24, 2025 – The Board of Directors of TotalEnergies SE met on March 19, 2025 under the chairmanship of Mr. Patrick Pouyanné, Chairman and Chief Executive Officer. It has decided to convene the Ordinary and Extraordinary Shareholders’ Meeting of the Corporation on Friday, May 23, 2025. The Notice of Meeting will be published […]",
